msgstr "يُرفض تصدير Excel ما دامت هذه الفلاتر مفعّلة. احذفها لتتمكن من التصدير."

msgid "{0} subtotal rows of the report itself (opening, total and closing of its own groups) are hidden while a filter, a grouping or a sort is applied: they describe the report as it came, not the rows shown now."
